{"id":"p2-001","instruction":"在原点创建一个 24x12x8 的方块，设为 RGB(255,128,0) 橙色；绕世界原点 Z 轴旋转 90 度后，再沿 X 轴正方向移动 18。","tags":["single","edit","rotate","move","color"],"difficulty":3,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,128,0]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[255,128,0]},"props":{"size":[12,24,8],"center":[12,12,4]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-002","instruction":"制作一根半径 4、高 20、RGB(128,0,128) 的紫色圆柱，先整体放大 1.5 倍，再把它的球心位置沿 Y 轴移动到 35。","tags":["single","cylinder","scale","move","color"],"difficulty":3,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[128,0,128]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[128,0,128]},"props":{"size":[12,12,30],"center":[0,35,10]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-003","instruction":"在原点创建一个 16x16x16 的青色方块，先沿 X 轴移动 30，再绕世界原点 Z 轴旋转 180 度，最后把颜色改成纯黄色。","tags":["single","edit","move","rotate","color","revision"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,255,0]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[255,255,0]},"props":{"size":[16,16,16],"center":[-38,-8,8]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-004","instruction":"从原点画一条沿 Y 轴、长度 30 的直线，绕世界原点 Z 轴旋转 90 度，再沿 Y 轴负方向移动 12。","tags":["single","line","rotate","move","spatial"],"difficulty":3,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":"Curve"},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"type":"Curve"},"props":{"size":[30,0,0],"center":[-15,-12,0]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-005","instruction":"创建一个半径 10 的蓝色球体；将它沿 X 轴移动 25，缩放到原来的 0.6 倍，并沿 Z 轴上移到球底位于 Z=0。","tags":["single","sphere","move","scale","perception","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"props":{"size":[12,12,12],"center":[25,0,6]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-006","instruction":"建一个 10x30x6 的红色长方体，在其右侧创建一个同尺寸绿色长方体；把绿色长方体绕自己的中心旋转 90 度，并使两者中心距离为 30。","tags":["compose","rotate","spatial","color","perception"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":2},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,255,0]},"props":{"size":[30,10,6]},"tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"distance","value":30,"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-007","instruction":"在原点依次创建红、绿、蓝、黄四个 8x8x8 方块，先任意分散，再沿 X 轴等距分布，使相邻方块的中心间距为 20。","tags":["array","distribute","edit","color","recovery"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":4},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"axis_distance","value":{"axis":"x","value":20},"tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[0,255,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"axis_distance","value":{"axis":"x","value":20},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-008","instruction":"在原点生成一个 40x10x10、RGB(100,100,100) 的灰色方块，绕世界原点 Z 轴旋转 90 度；随后把它沿 X 轴移动 20、沿 Y 轴移动 5。","tags":["single","rotate","move","multi_step","color"],"difficulty":3,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[100,100,100]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[100,100,100]},"props":{"size":[10,40,10],"center":[15,25,5]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-009","instruction":"创建半径 6、高 12 的白色圆柱；仅在 Z 方向缩放到原高度的 2.5 倍，然后把它的底面放回 Z=0。","tags":["single","cylinder","scale","align","color"],"difficulty":3,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,255,255]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[255,255,255]},"props":{"size":[12,12,30],"center":[0,0,15]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-010","instruction":"创建一个 18x6x6 的品红色方块，把它沿 X 轴移动 24 后绕世界原点 Z 轴旋转 270 度，再把颜色改成 RGB(0,128,255)。","tags":["single","rotate","move","color","revision"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,128,255]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,128,255]},"props":{"size":[6,18,6],"center":[3,-33,3]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-011","instruction":"创建一个 36x36x36、RGB(80,80,80) 的深灰色方块；在其 X/Y 正中心创建半径 14、高 44 的圆柱刀具，刀具底面位于 Z=-4、顶面穿出方块顶面；对方块执行布尔差集，最终只保留带中心贯穿圆孔的深灰方块。","tags":["boolean","compose","perception","recovery"],"difficulty":4,"requires_clean_tool_trace":true,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[80,80,80]},"props":{"size":[36,36,36]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-012","instruction":"建一个半径 18、高 28 的蓝色圆柱；在其中心建立一个半径 7、高 34 的圆柱并用后者从前者做布尔差集，留下蓝色空心圆柱。","tags":["boolean","cylinder","perception","spatial"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"props":{"size":[36,36,28]},"tol":1.2}]}
{"id":"p2-013","instruction":"画一个半径 12 的圆并沿 Z 轴拉伸 18 得到实体，将实体设为绿色；再把一个半径 4 的红色球体放在顶面正中心，要求球底紧贴实体顶面（球心 Z=22）。","tags":["extrude","circle","stack","spatial","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":2},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,255,0]},"props":{"size":[24,24,18]},"tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-014","instruction":"在原点画一个半径 16 的圆，向上拉伸 8；把拉伸体移到 X=30 后，再在其正中心挖去一个半径 6 的球形空腔。","tags":["extrude","boolean","move","perception"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"size":[32,32,8]},"props":{"center":[30,0,4]},"tol":1.2}]}
{"id":"p2-015","instruction":"创建一个 50x30x12 的黑色方块，在其内部正中心创建一个半径 15 的白色球；用球体从方块中做差集，并删除球体。","tags":["boolean","stack","delete","perception","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,0,0]},"props":{"size":[50,30,12]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-016","instruction":"从原点画半径 9 的圆，拉伸成高 40 的实体后缩放到 0.5 倍；将最终实体设置为黄色，并让底面保持在 Z=0。","tags":["circle","extrude","scale","color","perception"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,255,0]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[255,255,0]},"props":{"size":[9,9,20],"center":[0,0,10]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-017","instruction":"做一个 32x32x20 的红色盒体，再做一个半径 11 的球体与盒体同心；完成布尔差集后，仅将结果沿 Y 轴正方向移动 45。","tags":["boolean","move","concentric","perception","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"props":{"size":[32,32,20],"center":[16,61,10]},"tol":1.2}]}
{"id":"p2-018","instruction":"建立半径 20 的圆，向上拉伸 6 形成圆盘；再建立半径 8 的圆柱贯穿圆盘中心并做差集，最后把结果设为 RGB(180,180,180) 的浅灰色。","tags":["circle","extrude","boolean","color","perception"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[180,180,180]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[180,180,180]},"props":{"size":[40,40,6]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-019","instruction":"创建一个 44x24x16 的蓝色方块，再在它中心创建半径 10 的球体；用球体切除方块后，将结果绕自身中心 Z 轴旋转 90 度。","tags":["boolean","rotate","perception","multi_step"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"props":{"size":[24,44,16]},"tol":1.2}]}
{"id":"p2-020","instruction":"画一个半径 10 的圆并向上拉伸 22；在同一中心创建半径 4、高 28 的圆柱，用圆柱挖穿拉伸体；最终保留一个 RGB(128,0,128) 的紫色穿孔实体。","tags":["extrude","boolean","cylinder","perception","color"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[128,0,128]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[128,0,128]},"props":{"size":[20,20,22]},"tol":1.2}]}
{"id":"p2-021","instruction":"先创建红色 12x12x12、绿色 12x12x24、蓝色 12x12x18 三个方块，分别放在 X=0、25、50；找出最高的绿色方块，在其顶面正中心放一个半径 5 的黄色球体，要求球底紧贴绿色方块顶面（球心 Z=29）。","tags":["perception","select","stack","spatial","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":4},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,0]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-022","instruction":"建一个半径 18 的白色球体，然后把它改为半径 9 的蓝色球体；在完成后调用场景摘要确认尺寸和颜色。","tags":["perception","revision","scale","color","single"],"difficulty":3,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"props":{"size":[18,18,18]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-023","instruction":"创建三个 10x10x10 方块：红色在原点、绿色在 X=20、蓝色在 X=40；删除绿色方块，再用一条直线连接红色和蓝色方块的中心。","tags":["perception","delete","line","spatial","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":["Polysurface","Extrusion"]},"n":2},{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":"Curve"},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"type":"Curve"},"props":{"size":[40,0,0]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-024","instruction":"创建一个 20x20x10、RGB(100,100,100) 的灰色底座和两个半径 4 的球体，先把球体都放错颜色；最终将左侧球改红、右侧球改绿，并让两个球的球底均紧贴底座顶面（球心 Z=14）。","tags":["perception","revision","stack","color","recovery"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"n":1},{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,255,0]},"n":1},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[100,100,100]},"relation":"supported_by","tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[0,255,0]},"b":{"color":[100,100,100]},"relation":"supported_by","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-025","instruction":"建立半径 5、高度分别为 15、35、25 的三根圆柱，底面都在 Z=0 且沿 X 轴排列；只在最高圆柱顶面中心放一个半径 3 的品红色球。","tags":["perception","cylinder","select","stack","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,0,255]},"n":1},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,255]},"b":{"size":[10,10,35]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-026","instruction":"先创建一个 30x10x10 的绿色方块并沿 X 轴正方向移动 35；发现方向不对后绕世界原点 Z 轴旋转 90 度，最后确认它不再沿 X 轴延伸。","tags":["perception","rotate","move","revision","recovery"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,255,0]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,255,0]},"props":{"size":[10,30,10],"center":[-5,50,5]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-027","instruction":"创建半径 8 的黄色球和 16x16x4 的黑色底板；先把球移动到错误高度，再把球放回底板顶面正中心。","tags":["perception","move","place","stack","recovery"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-028","instruction":"创建红、蓝两个半径 6 的球，初始中心都在原点；把红球移动到 X=20、蓝球移动到 X=-20，并通过场景摘要确认两球中心距离为 40。","tags":["perception","move","distance","color","spatial"],"difficulty":3,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":"Surface"},"n":2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"distance","value":40,"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-029","instruction":"建立一个 24x24x24 的红色方块和一个 12x12x12 的蓝色方块；把蓝色方块缩放到 20x20x20，并让两个方块的 X/Y 中心保持一致但蓝色方块位于红色方块上方。","tags":["perception","scale","align","stack","spatial"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"props":{"size":[20,20,20]},"tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[0,0,255]},"b":{"color":[255,0,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-030","instruction":"创建两个 14x14x14 方块，分别设为红色和蓝色；将蓝色方块旋转 45 度后，恢复到与红色方块相同的轴向尺寸，并把它们放在 Y 轴相距 30 的位置。","tags":["perception","rotate","recovery","distance","color"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":2},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"props":{"size":[14,14,14]},"tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"distance","value":30,"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-031","instruction":"创建三根半径 3、高 24 的红色圆柱，沿 X 轴排列后全部打成群组「三柱组」；将整个群组成员移动到 Y=30 的同一排。","tags":["group","array","move","cylinder","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"三柱组"},"n":3},{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"n":3}]}
{"id":"p2-032","instruction":"制作一个 40x20x4 的桌面板和四根 4x4x24 的桌腿，全部加入「工作台」群组；桌腿顶面贴合桌面板底面。","tags":["group","compose","spatial","perception","high_complexity"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"工作台"},"n":5},{"kind":"count","selector":{"size":[4,4,24]},"n":4},{"kind":"property","selector":{"size":[40,20,4]},"props":{"size":[40,20,4]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-033","instruction":"沿 Y 轴创建五个 12x3x3 的黄色横条，并归入「警示纹」群组；随后把全部对象放到图层「安全标识」。","tags":["array","group","layer","color","compose"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"警示纹"},"n":5},{"kind":"count","selector":{"layer":"安全标识"},"n":5}]}
{"id":"p2-034","instruction":"创建两个红色 10x10x10 方块，分别放在 X=0 和 X=20，并组成「双块」群组；再在 X=40 创建一个蓝色 10x10x20 方块。先将三个方块移动到不同高度，最后把三个成员的底面沿 Z 轴最小端对齐到 Z=0。","tags":["group","align","spatial","color","recovery"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"双块"},"n":2},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"props":{"center":[45,5,10]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-035","instruction":"做一个由 6 个半径 2、高 20 的白色圆柱组成的「围栏二」群组；把这个群组中的全部柱子移到图层「结构层」。","tags":["array","group","layer","cylinder","perception"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"围栏二"},"n":6},{"kind":"count","selector":{"layer":"结构层"},"n":6}]}
{"id":"p2-036","instruction":"创建红、绿、蓝三个 8x8x8 方块，打成「色块列」群组；先沿 X 轴分散，再使用等距分布让相邻中心距离变为 16。","tags":["group","distribute","array","color","edit"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"色块列"},"n":3},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"distance","value":16,"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-037","instruction":"创建一个半径 14 的绿色球体和一个半径 8 的蓝色球体，使两者同心；将两个球共同放入「同心球」群组。","tags":["group","concentric","sphere","spatial","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"同心球"},"n":2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[0,255,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"concentric","tol":0.8}]}
{"id":"p2-038","instruction":"用一个 30x30x3 的灰色底板和四个半径 3 的彩色球制作「四角灯」，把五个对象全部打组并放入图层「灯具」。","tags":["group","layer","compose","color","spatial"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"四角灯"},"n":5},{"kind":"count","selector":{"layer":"灯具"},"n":5}]}
{"id":"p2-039","instruction":"创建三层尺寸为 36x36x6、28x28x6、20x20x6 的方块，居中叠放并加入「阶梯座」群组；将所有成员设为 RGB(70,70,70) 的深灰色。","tags":["group","stack","align","color","compose"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"阶梯座"},"n":3},{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[70,70,70]},"n":3},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"size":[28,28,6]},"b":{"size":[36,36,6]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-040","instruction":"建立两根红色和两根蓝色半径 3、高 30 的圆柱，四根柱子加入「双色门架」群组；红蓝各自成对并在 X/Y 平面形成矩形四角。","tags":["group","cylinder","spatial","compose","color"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"双色门架"},"n":4},{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"n":2},{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"n":2}]}
{"id":"p2-041","instruction":"创建一个 30x30x5 的黑色基座，在顶面中心放半径 8 的红球；再让半径 4 的黄球紧贴红球正上方且三者 X/Y 中心对齐。","tags":["stack","spatial","compose","color","high_complexity"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":3},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,0]},"b":{"color":[255,0,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-042","instruction":"在 X=-25 和 X=25 分别竖立两根半径 4、高 36 的蓝色圆柱，并在两根柱子顶部之间画一条直线横梁。","tags":["line","cylinder","spatial","compose","distance"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"n":2},{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":"Curve"},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"type":"Curve"},"props":{"size":[50,0,0]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-043","instruction":"创建一个 20x20x20 的绿色方块，把半径 5 的白色球体贴合到方块前侧面的正中心。","tags":["place","spatial","compose","color","perception"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,255]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"distance","value":15,"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-044","instruction":"制作半径 20、高 4 的灰色圆盘，在圆盘顶面中心竖立半径 2、高 50 的黑色圆柱旗杆，并在旗杆顶面放半径 4 的红球。","tags":["stack","cylinder","spatial","compose","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":3},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"size":[4,4,50]},"b":{"size":[40,40,4]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"size":[4,4,50]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-045","instruction":"创建一块 50x18x4 的深灰平台；在平台顶部由左到右摆放红、黄、绿三个半径 5 的球，三球中心间距均为 14。","tags":["stack","array","spatial","color","compose"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":"Surface"},"n":3},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[255,255,0]},"relation":"distance","value":14,"tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,0]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"distance","value":14,"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-046","instruction":"在一个 24x24x6 的蓝色方块顶面正中心放一根半径 3、高 18 的白色圆柱；圆柱顶面再紧贴放一个半径 4、RGB(255,128,0) 的橙色球。","tags":["stack","cylinder","spatial","compose","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":3},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"size":[6,6,18]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,128,0]},"b":{"size":[6,6,18]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-047","instruction":"在原点创建一颗半径 10 的红球，在 X=30 创建半径 10 的蓝球；再以两球正中位置创建一个半径 6 的黄球，使三个球的球心共线。","tags":["sphere","spatial","distance","color","compose"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":"Surface"},"n":3},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[255,255,0]},"relation":"distance","value":15,"tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"distance","value":15,"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-048","instruction":"创建一个 40x24x8 的白色方块作为底座，在底座左、右两端的顶面各放一颗半径 5 的红球，两个红球的高度和 Y 坐标保持一致。","tags":["compose","stack","spatial","color","symmetry"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"n":2},{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":3}]}
{"id":"p2-049","instruction":"建立两个半径 12 的球体，一个红色、一个蓝色，让它们在 X 轴上外接相切；红球位于原点，蓝球位于右侧。","tags":["sphere","spatial","tangent","color","compose"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":"Surface"},"n":2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"tangent","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-050","instruction":"创建半径 16、RGB(0,255,0) 的纯绿色球体，围绕它在 X/Y 平面四个方向放置半径 4 的红、黄、蓝、白小球，每个小球都与绿球外接相切。","tags":["sphere","spatial","tangent","compose","high_complexity"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":"Surface"},"n":5},{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,255,0]},"n":1},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"tangent","tol":1.2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,0]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"tangent","tol":1.2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[0,0,255]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"tangent","tol":1.2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,255]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"tangent","tol":1.2}]}
{"id":"p2-051","instruction":"创建一个 18x18x18 的红色方块，然后额外创建一个 10x10x10 的蓝色方块；执行一次 Undo 撤销蓝色方块，最终只保留红色方块。","tags":["undo","recovery","revision","color","single"],"difficulty":3,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"props":{"size":[18,18,18]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-052","instruction":"先创建一个半径 9 的黄色球和一个半径 5 的蓝色球；撤销最后创建的蓝色球，再调用场景摘要确认只剩黄色球。","tags":["undo","sphere","perception","recovery","color"],"difficulty":3,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[255,255,0]},"props":{"size":[18,18,18]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-053","instruction":"创建三个 10x10x10 方块并依次设为红、绿、蓝；在把三者打组之前误建一个黄色方块，使用 Undo 删除误建对象后再完成群组「三色块」。","tags":["undo","group","recovery","color","compose"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":3},{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"三色块"},"n":3}]}
{"id":"p2-054","instruction":"建立一个 30x30x4 的黑色底板，先创建半径 12 的红球但发现过大；撤销红球后创建半径 6 的红球并放到底板顶面中心。","tags":["undo","revision","stack","recovery","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":2},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"props":{"size":[12,12,12]},"tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-055","instruction":"创建一根半径 3、高 40 的绿色圆柱，再误创建一个 20x20x20 方块；Undo 撤销方块，并把圆柱移到 X=45。","tags":["undo","cylinder","move","recovery","color"],"difficulty":3,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,255,0]},"props":{"size":[6,6,40],"center":[45,0,20]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-056","instruction":"创建一个 20x20x20 的蓝色方块并将其绕 Z 轴旋转 45 度；发现不符合轴对齐要求，使用 Undo 回到未旋转方块。","tags":["undo","rotate","recovery","perception","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"props":{"size":[20,20,20]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-057","instruction":"画一条长度 30 的直线，再画一条长度 10 的直线；Undo 撤销短线后，将长线绕 Z 轴旋转 90 度。","tags":["undo","line","rotate","recovery","spatial"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":"Curve"},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"type":"Curve"},"props":{"size":[0,30,0]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-058","instruction":"创建两个白色 12x12x12 方块并准备打组；误将其中一个移动到 Z=40 后，用 Undo 回退移动，再把两个方块加入「白色双块」。","tags":["undo","group","move","recovery","color"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"白色双块"},"n":2},{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,255,255]},"n":2}]}
{"id":"p2-059","instruction":"先创建半径 14、RGB(128,0,128) 的紫色球体，再错误地缩放到一半；使用 Undo 恢复原始半径，并将球体沿 Y 轴负方向移动 30。","tags":["undo","sphere","scale","move","recovery"],"difficulty":4,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[128,0,128]},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[128,0,128]},"props":{"size":[28,28,28],"center":[0,-30,0]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-060","instruction":"创建一个红色 30x10x10 方块和一个蓝色 10x30x10 方块；误把蓝色方块设成绿色后使用 Undo 恢复蓝色，再将二者按 Z 轴底面对齐。","tags":["undo","align","recovery","color","compose"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"n":1},{"kind":"count","selector":{"color":[0,0,255]},"n":1}]}
{"id":"p2-061","instruction":"制作一个 60x30x4 的桌面和四根 5x5x32 的桌腿，桌腿顶面贴合桌面底面；将五个对象加入「实验桌」群组并设为灰色。","tags":["group","compose","spatial","color","high_complexity"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"实验桌"},"n":5},{"kind":"count","selector":{"size":[5,5,32]},"n":4},{"kind":"property","selector":{"size":[60,30,4]},"props":{"size":[60,30,4]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-062","instruction":"构建一座三层圆柱塔：底层半径 24 高 6、中层半径 16 高 8、顶层半径 8 高 10，三层 X/Y 居中且逐层紧贴叠放。","tags":["cylinder","stack","align","spatial","compose"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":3},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"size":[32,32,8]},"b":{"size":[48,48,6]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"size":[16,16,10]},"b":{"size":[32,32,8]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-063","instruction":"创建红色 40x40x40 方块；在其中心使用半径 24 的球体做差集，形成穿出外表面的球形切除；把结果放在 50x50x4 的黑色底座顶面正中心。","tags":["boolean","stack","perception","spatial","high_complexity"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":2},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"props":{"size":[40,40,40]},"tol":1.2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-064","instruction":"画半径 18 的圆并拉伸 30 得到绿色实体，在顶面居中放一个 16x16x8 的白色方块；随后将两者共同加入「圆台组件」群组。","tags":["extrude","stack","group","spatial","high_complexity"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"圆台组件"},"n":2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,255]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-065","instruction":"建立四个 10x10x20 方块，颜色为红绿蓝黄，形成边长 30 的正方形四角；将四者沿 Z 轴底面最小端对齐并打成「彩色塔阵」。","tags":["group","align","spatial","compose","color"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"彩色塔阵"},"n":4},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,255,0]},"relation":"distance","value":30,"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-066","instruction":"创建一个半径 15 的蓝色球体，在其正上、正下、正左、正右各放一个半径 3 的红、黄、白、品红小球，使四个小球都与蓝球相切并加入「环绕球」群组。","tags":["group","sphere","tangent","spatial","high_complexity"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"环绕球"},"n":4},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"tangent","tol":1.2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,0]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"tangent","tol":1.2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,255]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"tangent","tol":1.2},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,0,255]},"b":{"color":[0,0,255]},"relation":"tangent","tol":1.2}]}
{"id":"p2-067","instruction":"在 X=-25 和 X=25 创建两个半径 5、高 28 的黑色圆柱桥墩；在两墩顶部画一条横向直线，横梁中点为 (0,0,28)；在该中点正上方紧贴放半径 4 的红球，要求球心为 (0,0,32)。","tags":["cylinder","line","spatial","perception","high_complexity"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"type":"Curve"},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"type":"Curve"},"props":{"size":[50,0,0]},"tol":1.0},{"kind":"property","selector":{"color":[255,0,0]},"props":{"center":[0,0,32]},"tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-068","instruction":"做一个 48x48x6 的深灰底板，按红、黄、绿三层同心圆盘叠放，半径依次为 18、12、6，三层厚度均为 3；所有对象加入「信号靶盘」。","tags":["group","concentric","stack","color","high_complexity"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"信号靶盘"},"n":4},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[255,255,0]},"b":{"color":[255,0,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0},{"kind":"spatial","a":{"color":[0,255,0]},"b":{"color":[255,255,0]},"relation":"on_top_of","tol":1.0}]}
{"id":"p2-069","instruction":"创建红色 30x30x12 方块，在内部用半径 10 的球做差集；将成品绕世界原点 Z 轴旋转 90 度后沿 X 轴移动 40，并放入图层「布尔成品」。","tags":["boolean","rotate","move","layer","high_complexity"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{"layer":"布尔成品"},"n":1},{"kind":"property","selector":{"layer":"布尔成品"},"props":{"size":[30,30,12]},"tol":1.2}]}
{"id":"p2-070","instruction":"创建一个由 30x20x4 底板、两根 4x4x26 支柱和一根 36x4x4 横梁构成的门架；先误建一个球体再 Undo 撤销，最终把门架全部加入「可恢复门架」群组。","tags":["undo","group","compose","recovery","high_complexity"],"difficulty":5,"asserts":[{"kind":"count","selector":{},"n":4},{"kind":"count","selector":{"in_group":"可恢复门架"},"n":4},{"kind":"count","selector":{"size":[4,4,26]},"n":2}]}
